  "intro": [
    "This fresh Z3 route uses seed 1 and reaches the story\u2019s stated 600-point maximum. It escapes the alarm in the Outer Vault, rescues Belboz\u2019s key, and replaces the shadow\u2019s magic cube with the sack.",
    "Learn spells only when prompted. The simulated transformations are temporary. At the grouper nest, wait until you become yourself again before taking the loose items; the vault\u2019s correct cube is seed-dependent.",
    "The route ends after the Scientist ending by answering QUIT. It records 348 commands and 455 moves with no player-death message."
